  "prefLabel": "Ins 801.15 Lines of Insurance Without a Statistical Agent",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 801.15 Lines of Insurance Without a Statistical Agent. Any licensed insurer writing any line of insurance not exempted in Ins 801.02 that finds or believes to have found that it is writing a line or type of insurance for which no statistical agent will accept data shall notify the commissioner of this fact as soon as practicable.\n\nSource. #9053, eff 1-2-08; ss by #11008, eff 12-31-15 (from Ins 801.15); ss by #14505, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36 (formerly Ins 801.16)",
